&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Physical Demands&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ability to sit, stand, walk, climb, bend, push, carry, etc. for 10 hours at a time; ability to lift 20lbs unaided; ability to ascend and descend stairs; ability to grasp and use small parts; ability to occasionally kneel, crouch, bend as required to perform tasks; etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Within the Axon manufacturing facility, employees may be exposed to manufacturing noise, ambient temperatures, close quarters, hazards associated with working around moving machinery, exposure to vibrations and industrial lighting, etc.&lt;/p&gt;
