&lt;li&gt;Architect the next generation of the continuous deployment framework for AI on device and cloud.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable new AI feature on existing and new Axon’s devices by optimizing models for the edge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with scientists in architecting and implementing state-of-the-art training techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
