&lt;li&gt;Effective communication and strong presentation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to balance and prioritize conflicting design constraints through analysis, testing, and creativity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaboration with peers in a candid cross-functional team culture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
