&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;1,1,0,0&quot;&gt;8+ years of professional software development experience with a proven track record of executing broad technical initiatives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;1,2,0,0&quot;&gt;Experience designing and delivering highly-available, scalable cloud-based systems and platform components or foundational services that support multiple teams and products&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
