&lt;li&gt;Experience building and operating public cloud-hosted services on Azure or AWS using Kubernetes and Infrastructure as Code (IaC) tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of platform security concerns: identity, access control, data encryption, and secure service-to-service communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;1,7,0,0&quot;&gt;Experience driving SLOs, SLAs, operational excellence, and an incident response culture across multi-team engineering organizations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;1,8,0,0&quot;&gt;Experience evaluating, integrating, and establishing organizational standards for AI-assisted development tools into engineering workflows&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-path-to-node=&quot;1,9,0,0&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of how AI can be applied to improve developer productivity, system design, and operational efficiency at a multi-squad level&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
