&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;5 to 7 years of experience as an Art Director or Senior Designer in a brand, agency, or in-house creative environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A portfolio that demonstrates range across campaign creative, brand design, event and experiential work, and digital content&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
