&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Competitive salary and 401k with employer match&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Discretionary paid time off&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Paid parental leave for all&lt;/p&gt;
