&lt;p&gt;Experience with Workday or similar HRIS/payroll systems&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Exposure to global payroll providers and multi-country payroll environments&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Understanding of payroll tax regulations and compliance requirements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrated ability to&amp;nbsp;identify&amp;nbsp;process improvements and drive efficiency&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong organizational and communication skills in a fast-paced environment&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits That Benefit You:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual gross base salary of RON 125,000-155,000 (flexible depending on experience)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;10% performance bonus, with acceleration to 15% based on over-performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;24 days holiday, plus spot company holidays and downtime&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private medical insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company issues hardware with a choice between Mac and Windows, and other selected hardware&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous training, learning, and development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;International engagements and travel opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Eligibility for our connectivity stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Don’t meet every single requirement? That&#39;s ok. At Axon, we Aim Far. We think big with a long-term view because we want to reinvent the world to be a safer, better place. We are also committed to building diverse teams that reflect the communities we serve.&lt;/p&gt;
