&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join Axon and be a Force for Good.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Axon, we’re on a mission to Protect Life. We’re explorers, pursuing society’s most critical safety and justice issues with our ecosystem of devices and cloud software. Like our products, we work better together. We connect with candor and care, seeking out diverse perspectives from our customers, communities and each other.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Life at Axon is fast-paced, challenging and meaningful. Here, you’ll take ownership and drive real change. Constantly grow as you work hard for a mission that matters at a company where you matter.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On the Real Time Operations (RTO) team, we&#39;re building the next generation of edge computing and live video technology for mission-critical operations. Through Fusus, we unify live video, sensor data, and alerts into a single operational platform that helps first responders and security professionals make faster, better decisions. Our team builds the high-performance video streaming technology that powers Axon Body cameras and Fusus edge devices, solving challenging problems across embedded systems, networking, media processing, and cloud services. At Axon, our mission is to Protect Life.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Your Impact &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Build the native software behind real-time video streaming for Axon Body cameras and Fusus edge devices. You&#39;ll develop high-performance systems software that delivers reliable, low-latency video from edge devices to cloud services, solving challenging problems in media processing, networking, performance, and reliability. Your work will help first responders access live video when it matters most.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;This role is based out of our Seattle office and follows a hybrid schedule. We rely on in-person collaboration and ask that team members work onsite Tuesdays through Fridays, with the flexibility to work remotely on Mondays, unless there is an approved workplace accommodation. We believe that connection fuels innovation, and our in-office culture is designed to foster meaningful teamwork, mentorship, and shared success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reports to:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Senior Software Engineering Manager&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build modern C++ and Rust software that powers real-time video streaming on Axon Body cameras and Fusus edge devices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the performance, reliability, and maintainability of native streaming services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design native APIs and SDKs that enable seamless integration across edge, mobile, and cloud platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with engineers across embedded software, cloud, and machine learning to deliver new streaming capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape the architecture and technical direction of Axon&#39;s native streaming platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical design discussions and mentor teammates through thoughtful code reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Required&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional experience building production software in modern C++ or Rust.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing, debugging, and optimizing native systems software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of concurrency, performance, and software design fundamentals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable collaborating across multiple layers of the software stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Embedded Linux or IoT development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Video, media, or streaming technologies (GStreamer, FFmpeg, WebRTC, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;SDK, library, or API development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Networking or distributed systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits that Benefit You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive salary and 401k with employer match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discretionary paid time off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave for all&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical, Dental, Vision plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fitness Programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Emotional &amp;amp; Mental Wellness support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learning &amp;amp; Development programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Resource Groups (ERGs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;And yes, we have snacks in our offices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
