&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2–4+ years of experience in coordination, operations, project support, or a similar role in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in a customer-facing role, with the ability to communicate clearly and professionally with external stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills with the ability to manage multiple workflows, timelines, and priorities simultaneously.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting scheduling, project coordination, and financial tracking (POs/invoices).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High attention to detail with a focus on data accuracy and process consistency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to identify issues early and escalate effectively with clear communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong interpersonal and communication skills, with the ability to work across cross-functional teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in common business systems (e.g., CRM platforms, project management tools, spreadsheets, and collaboration tools).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate both independently and collaboratively in an evolving, high-growth environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience computer network implementation, encompassing systems software, applications software, hardware, and configuration management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
